# Selftest

Import RolesVerify from "./roles_verify.lg".
Import LocalRun from "./local_run.lg".
Import SelftestRecords from "./selftest_records.lg".
Import SelftestPolicy from "./selftest_policy.lg".
Import SelftestSources from "./selftest_sources.lg".
Import SelftestLive from "./selftest_live.lg".
Import HostTools from "./host_tools.lg".

`factory selftest` runs, from the project directory, every check that crosses
modules — the integration the leaf `## Test`s cannot hold. `--live` adds the
checks that run the real kernel: the judged submissions, the kernel reference,
and the local loop.

## To runSelftest (live: Bool) -> Outcome:
    Let mutable groups be [recordChecks(), trailChecks(), fixtureChecks(), policyChecks(), openRouterChecks(), manifestChecks(), atlasChecks()].
    Let mutable count be 7.
    If live:
        Set groups to groups + [judgeChecks(), loopChecks(), referenceProblems(defaultToolchain())].
        Set count to 10.
    Let mutable failures be a new Seq of Text.
    Repeat for g in groups:
        Set failures to failures + g.
    If length of failures is equal to 0:
        Return done("selftest passed: {count} groups of checks, nothing failed").
    Return failed("selftest failed:\n- " + join(failures, "\n- ")).
